<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- MUNGA BIBLE TRANSLA TION PROJECI</book>
  <para style="h">1Timitawos</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nungvullǝ gi Bulus sua TIMITAWOS</para>
  <para style="toc2">1Timitawos</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Ti</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nungvullǝ gi Bulus A Nwasiu Sua</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMITAWOS</para>
  <para style="imt">Ɓǝ bai piu</para>
  <para style="ip">Timitawos, munthang a tuab ya krista dang Asiya a tuab, na gu ǝn ya Yahudawa langkwoi daa gu ǝn ya Helinawa. U mǝrǝm lǝ ya dǝsua langkwoi lǝ ya nwong Bulus bǝ tonungto ba gi Fuh. <char style="bk" closed="false">Nungvullǝ gi Bulus a nungsi sua Timitawos </char><char style="bk" closed="false">Dǝ nyitthǝ lo nung tai</char></para>
  <para style="ip">Nungvullǝ gu la nwasiu ǝn ba bǝ gub ɗuogsui lo bǝ nanatthǝ nung angǝ bǝɓa kǝb pǝlǝ dang kǝm pinwa. Ba nanatthǝ nung ɓǝ, i gǝm ya Yahudawa langkwoi i ya kwɔ ǝn ya Yahudawa lǝu ɓǝ, bǝ nanatthǝ nungi nyimlo ɓǝ dǝ ǝngha ttha longwam kwɔ ɓi dang wu ǝn mungkulum langkwoi yuu a soblo i ɓǝ i bai nung Apya pya langkwoi ɓa nanung ɓǝ gǝm i ɓa tang nung tang a kun langkwoi yuu dǝb yisiu. Nungvullǝ ɓǝ langkwoi gǝm i ɓǝ gub ɗuogsui lo ɓa to nungto kǝm pinwa langkwoi i ɓa wabnung, i ɓǝ geiba lo kiggǝ kwɔ kǝm pinwa yakuu langkwoi i ya nwongǝi a tǝi ɓǝ, Ɓǝ al long ǝndǝi, Timitawos nko na tthǝ nung lǝi kwɔ u aa lǝ ya thǝb gi Yeso Kristi langkwoi i ba tonungto kwɔ u to lo ya dǝ ba a langǝ i.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Ɓang Bulus dǝmǝn vullǝ nungvullǝ kwɔ. Ɓang ya nwatummi gi Yeso Kristi i bǝ yiɗi gi Dangbang ya sob lo i Kristi Yeso ya dǝnyitthǝ ɓi <verse eid="1TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />Dǝmǝn vullǝ nungvullǝ suamǝ Timitawos, yuim a langǝ i dang bǝ dǝnyitthǝ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 1:2">Kaso Fuh Daa langkwoi Kristi Yeso Dangbang ɓi da nung a langǝ i, ɓyǝa nungzuii, i bǝ ǝǝ a langǝ i.<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bǝ Gub Ɗuogsui Lobǝ Nanatthǝnung Pǝllǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Dǝmǝn yidɗi a ǝǝ Afisa, manungkwɔ ǝn geitthǝ kwɔ ɓang lo nunglǝi bǝtǝ Makidoniya ɓǝ. Yakun bǝilǝ dǝna nanatthǝ nung pǝllǝ, langkwoi a gei i yitthǝ. <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />A geitthǝ i yitthǝ mum muani aku kwɔ i ɗuǝn ya bǝba kwɔ, kwɔ dǝna wɔlǝ bǝ nyimnwa ɓuoɓǝ; i to nungto nunglǝi Fuh, kwɔ i ibǝi i bǝ dǝnyitthǝ. <verse eid="1TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Bakwɔ yangbǝ ǝǝr lǝ bǝ yiɗi bǝi kwɔ dǝna wɔ dang wa a langǝ i, i bǝ dǝnyitthǝ a langǝ i. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Yayuu yakun mǝrrǝm yitthǝ i nunglǝi ɓǝkwɔ dǝi gei ba a nǝkwam. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Dǝi yiɗi bǝ mǝrrǝm lǝ ya nanatthǝ zuu gi Musa, kwoi i ibǝ nungkwɔ dǝi gei ɓǝ lǝu kwɔ dǝi gei i tthǝ nyimmi <verse eid="1TI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Ɓi ibǝi zuu gi Musa maɗing nǝ yuu to lǝ nung to nunglǝi a langǝ i kwɔ kaso i to lǝ nung to ɓǝ. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />Ɓi nhǝm, la langǝ i, i mab zuu gi Musa, lǝ ba ya nung to a langǝ i lǝu, kwoi ǝn ba yakwɔ dǝna la bǝ to nung to i zuu ya la bǝ to nung a langǝ iu, ba yakwɔ to ba Fuh ko langkwoi ya nung a ɓko, ba yakwɔ i yangǝu i nung wab biu ɓǝ ko dang ɓyang ɓǝ, ba yakwɔ dǝna thǝb daagi ko naa gi, ba ya thǝbbǝi, <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />ba ya to nung a ɓko, ya lo i yasi i yaɓǝi, ya i yayuu lǝ ba nungkurɓǝ, ya kǝb pǝllǝ ya gam nwa yayuu ko yuu akwɔ dǝna to nungkwɔ dǝna bai tthangǝ i bǝ nanatthǝ nung a langǝ i ɓǝ. <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />Bǝ nanatthǝ nungɓǝ kwɔ dang nwaba a langǝ i kwɔ i dǝm angǝ ǝn geiɓǝ, Nwaba a Langǝ i bǝgǝ Fuh ya ghaali i ya khana lo.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bǝ To Sakko Lǝ Fuh Babǝ Ɓyǝa Nungzuii Gu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Dǝmǝn to sakko lǝ Kristi Yeso Dangbang ɓi, yuu akwɔ dǝm ttha lǝba nungtom. Dǝmǝn tou sakko kwɔ u ɓyǝam lǝ ya langǝ i langkwoi dǝm nung to bǝ tou nung to tthǝ, <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />ko kwɔ viikwɔ dǝm gei ba a ɓko tthǝ Fuh langkwoi ǝn dǝ zuii ǝn dalǝu. Kwoi Fuh ɓyǝa nung zuiim bakwɔ yirrǝ ǝn yangǝu i bǝ dǝnyitthǝu langkwoi ǝn ibǝi nungkwɔ dǝm to ɓǝ lǝu. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Langkwoi Dangbang ɓi al nung a langǝ i gu kpaatthǝ lom lǝ langkwoi dǝm dǝnyitthǝ ibǝ yiɗi bǝi kwɔ ǝn aɓi dang tha i Kristi Yeso ɓǝ. <verse eid="1TI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Nungkwɔ ǝn ba a langǝ i, kwɔ i gwabbǝm langkwoi i dǝ ba a langǝ i tthǝm lǝ: Kristi Yeso wuo longwam babǝ nwong lo ya nung aɓau. Ɓanglǝ yaɓau dang ǝi ǝndǝi. <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Kwoi Fuh ɓyǝa nungzuiim yangbǝ Kristi Yeso tam dang nyiu ibǝ to nung to i ɓanglǝ, ɓang kwɔ nung aɓau kpaani ɓǝ, ɓanglǝ nungkwɔ yayuu a naɓǝ yakwɔ a dǝ ba a langǝ i tthǝulǝ na tthǝɓǝ langkwoi i tǝi nwongǝi a ɗing. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Yigwoi a ɗing, yuu akwɔ ɓuiu kwɔ langkwoi nung ɓuan ɓyǝko, Fuh kunɗǝng-bǝ dǝ angǝ a i ghaali laɗing langkwoi laɗing! Dǝitthǝ manungɓǝ. <verse eid="1TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Yuim, Timitawos, ǝn da bakwɔ, kwɔ natha i ba a tthasi kwɔ i gei viikwɔ lǝba mǝ ɓǝ. Ato nung to i balǝ kwɔ mangǝ ǝn nung taɓui a ɓuob lǝ vǝm matthǝ, <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />langkwoi adǝ bǝ dǝnyi tthǝmǝ matthǝ i loyi a langǝ i. Yakun labǝ lǝ lonyii langkwoi i ɓanglǝ bǝ dǝnyitthǝ gi. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Dangǝi lǝ ǝn Himinayas i iskandari, kwɔ ǝn ji zuii ibǝ tana tthǝi lǝ Shǝtan ɓǝ; nungkwɔ a nainatthǝ nung i yitthǝ bǝ gei nung aɓau tthǝ Fuh.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Bǝ Wabnung Kǝm Pinwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />La nwasiu ǝndǝi, dǝmǝn geiɓǝ, bǝ ɓuobnwa, pinwa, bǝ yamnung, i bǝto sakko lǝ Fuh ba yayuu ǝndǝi.<verse eid="1TI 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />Bakwɔ ya yigwoi i yakwɔ dǝna dǝ kabnwa nung, ɓi ǝǝ la langǝ i latthǝ langkwoi i nwongǝi dǝɓi dǝ angǝ a lǝ Fuh i kiggǝ a langǝ i. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Nungkwɔ maɗing, langkwoi Fuh ya nwong lo ɓi dǝna lǝtthǝ lko, <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />Fuh kwɔ dǝna yiɗi yayuu ǝndǝi sob lo langkwoi ibǝ ba a langǝ i. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Bakwɔ Fuh ni kun ɗǝng ɓuo, kwɔ ganglang Fuh i yayuu, yuu ɓǝkwɔ lǝ Kristi Yeso, <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />yuu kwɔ dǝ lo lǝ nwathan thayuu ǝndǝi. Nungɓǝlǝ shǝdǝ kwɔ yayuu a ɓyǝa ɓǝ lona a langǝ i kwɔ Fuh dǝna yiɗi ko ǝn ya ǝndǝi sob lo, <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />langkwoi nungkwɔ i tummǝm lǝ ya nwatummi iya nanatthǝ nung yakwɔ ǝn ya Yahudawa lǝu ɓǝ, tǝn gei nwaba dǝnyitthǝ. Dǝmǝn kǝb pǝllǝ lǝu; Dǝmǝn gei ǝnba a langǝ i!<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Bǝ wab Fuh kǝm pinwa ǝndǝi dǝm yiɗi yaɓǝi pinwa, yaɓǝi kwɔ dǝ tthǝi bǝ to nung to Fuh kwɔ a ɓuan a lǝi nai wayi dang bǝ pinwa nyi yangǝu ko bǝ nyimtha nwa. <verse eid="1TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />Langɓǝ dǝmǝn yiɗi yasi linung litthǝ langkwoi i nhǝm ba nunglitthǝ gi langkwoi i li nunglitthǝ zinariya; bǝ i vǝm lo ma pǝll ttha thǝ ko i nung li dul nung a yummi nunglitthǝ nungkurɓǝu kpaani ɓǝthǝ, <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />kwoi i nung to a langǝ i, manung a bǝ yasi kwɔ dǝna lǝi angǝ i ǝn ya wab Fuh ɓǝ. <verse eid="1TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Yasi a nanung i kiggǝ langkwoi i bǝ ɓuob loi sua. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Ən gwab kwɔ i nanatthǝ nung ko i ǝǝlǝ ya dǝkab nwa nung lo yaɓǝi ɓǝlǝu; i kǝrnwa nǝkwam. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Bakwɔ Fuh osi mab Adamu nungsi, nwunibǝ Hawwa'u. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Langkwoi ǝn Adamu Shǝtan ɗam lǝu. Ən yisi Shǝtan ɗammu u ɓanglǝ zuu gi Fuh. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Kwoi Fuh a sob lo yisi tthǝbǝ si yathang, nǝ u nyimnyi dang bǝ dǝnyitthǝ ibǝ yiɗi bǝi i nung a langǝ i matthǝ ɓǝ.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Yakku Ya Kǝm Pinwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Nungkwɔ ǝnba a langǝ i kwɔ dǝi gei angǝ: nǝ yuu dǝna yidɗi bǝ ǝǝlǝ yikku kǝm pinwa yang, u mko nungto a langǝ ing.<verse eid="1TI 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Bǝ i tǝi yikku kǝm pinwa i nung a ɓko thǝ, yuu akwɔ siu kun ɓuoɓǝ, yuu kwɔ dǝna nhǝm ba lo i nkolǝ, dǝna muolo matthǝ, dǝi du angǝ a; ya muo yayol gwoi gulǝ; u ɓuan u nanatthǝ nung. <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />Ya nwa min pǝl ttha lǝu, ko ya nyi lǝu, kwoi ya lo nyi a tǝmmi ibǝ ǝǝ a langǝ i; ya yiɗi nungkurɓǝ lǝu; <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />u ɓuan u kang ya dang woi gu matthǝ u to yathang gu to nung to i bagu i bǝ dǝ angǝ a. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />Bakwɔ nǝ yuu ibǝi nunglǝi kwɔ a muo ya dang woi gu matthǝ lǝu, u tonǝnǝ u muo ya kǝm pinwa gi Fuh? <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Yuu akwɔ ghaang dang bǝ dǝnyitthǝ ɓǝ, yangbǝ bǝ lo fǝm i lo angǝ a langkwoi u o dang kwan, manung a bǝ Mungkullum thǝ . <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />U lǝ yuu akwɔ yakwɔ ǝn ya kǝm pinwa lǝu dǝna du angǝ a ɓǝ, yangbǝ bǝ i du tthǝkku u o dang tarko gi Mungkullum thǝ.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ya Nung to Kǝm Pinwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Ya nung to kǝm pinwa langɓǝ ǝǝlǝ ya to kiggǝ a langǝ i langkwoi ya ba a langǝ i; bǝ i nwa min kpaani thǝ ko yakwɔ yiɗi nungkurɓǝ ni ɓǝ; <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />i muo natthǝ ba a langǝ i kwɔ i geitthǝ babǝ dǝnyitthǝ i lo nyi a langǝ i. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />I nai la nwasiu, langkwoi yang, nǝ i tang bǝ nabǝi ɓǝ, yang i to nung to. <verse eid="1TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Yasi gi langɓǝ ya to kiggǝ a langǝ i langkwoi ya gum tthǝ bǝi lǝu; ya nhǝm ba lo kiggǝi langkwoi yakwɔ i gwabtha i ilǝ dang nung ǝndǝi ɓǝ. <verse eid="1TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Ya wonatthǝ nung to kǝm pinwa a dǝb yisi kun ɓuo, langkwoi u ɓuan u muo yathang gu i ya dang woi gu matthǝ. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Ya wonatthǝ nung to kwɔ to nung to matthǝ i tǝi bǝ dǝi matthǝ langkwoi i gei ba i nyi nyimi lǝ ba bǝ dǝnyitthǝ gi dang Kristi Yeso.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nung Apya Gãtthǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Kwɔ dǝm vulla nungkwɔ tthǝ kwɔ, Tulǝu yang dǝm dǝnyitthǝ bǝ tǝsua mǝ. <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />Kwoi nǝ ǝn tǝ thǝmtthǝ lǝu, nung vullǝ kwɔ a nanatthǝ nunglǝi kwɔ ɓi to kiggǝ ɓi dang yayuu gi Fuh, nungkwɔ lǝ kǝm pinwa Fuh ya nwongǝi, nungkwɔ lǝ zuggǝ kǝm kwɔ muo ba a langǝ i ɓǝ. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Yuu akun yangǝu kwɔ a yǝrnwa ghaali nung a pya ba Fuh ɓiu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Kristi wuo dang tthǝ thayuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">Ɓyang tanatthǝ angǝ u lǝya langǝ i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">langkwoi ya nwatummi gi Fuh ɓyǝkong.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">I gei ba gu dang ya losua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">i dǝ ba a langǝ i tthǝu lǝ ǝndǝi dang longwam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">langkwoi i lǝiu i tǝllǝ wayi.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s">Ya Nanatthǝ Nung Pǝllǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Ɓyang a langǝ i gei kaitthǝ angǝ lona dǝna wɔ kwɔ yakun a yitthǝ bǝ dǝnyitthǝ; i to nung to i ɓyang ɗambǝi i muo bǝ nanatthǝ nung wa. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />I bǝ nanatthǝ nungɓǝ kwɔ ya ɗambǝi ya pǝllǝ a yǝb lǝibǝi ǝndǝi, kwɔ lo nyiǝ ɓumɓui ɓǝ, mangǝttǝn i li i lua. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />Yayuu manungkwɔni dǝna nanatthǝnung angǝ bǝ dǝbtha mko langkwoi i bǝ tang i nungtang akun. Kwoi Fuh mab i nungtang ɓǝkwɔ yangbǝ i tang, tthasua kwɔ na pinwa a kha Fuh ɓǝ, yakwɔ ǝnya dǝba a langǝ i langkwoi i ibǝ ba a langǝ i ɓǝ. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Nung ǝndǝi kwɔ Fuh mab kwɔ maɗing; nung akun yangǝu kwɔ i laɓǝ, kwoi i tang nung ǝndǝi ibǝ pinwa kha Fuh, <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />bakwɔ bagi Fuh ibǝ pinwa a mab nungɓǝ yang Fuh a gwab.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thǝb Gi Kristi Yeso A Langǝ i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Nǝ a gei nungkwɔ lǝ ya dǝ ba a langǝ i tthǝ, yang ma ǝǝlǝ thǝb a langǝ i gi Kristi Yeso, dǝma ghaa dang ba a langǝ i ibǝ dǝnyitthǝ ibǝ nanatthǝ nung a langǝ i kwɔ a naɓǝ. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Kwoi a la i mum muani kwɔ fuh yangǝu tthǝɓǝ, kwɔ labǝ geiu ɓǝ. A dǝ lomǝ dang bǝ nanung a langǝ i. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Nyim nung thǝuri tthǝ maɗing, kwoi bǝ nanung ɓyang maɗing, bakwɔ dǝna gwab nwa nwongǝi lakwɔ i tthasi. <verse eid="1TI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Ba kwɔ ǝnba a langǝ i, kwɔ i muo i dǝ ba a langǝ i tthǝɓǝ. <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />Ɓi ɗuong nungɓi langkwoi ɓi to nung to ɗing, bakwɔ ɓi dǝnyitthǝ Fuh ya nwongǝi, kwɔ lǝ ya sob lo yayuu ǝndǝi yakwɔ dǝ ba a langǝ itthǝ ɓǝ. <verse eid="1TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Ɓa nanatthǝ nungkwɔ yang ɓa gei lǝ yayuu tthǝ ǝndǝi to nung kwɔ ǝn gei ɓǝ. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Bǝ ɓa yi yuu akun tthǝm ɓǝ bakwɔ ɓǝ ǝn yathang thǝ, kwoi ɓa mǝrrǝm lǝ nungkwɔ ya dǝ ba a langǝ i a naɓǝ dang bǝ geiba, kiggǝ ɓǝ, bǝ yiɗi bǝi ɓǝ, bǝ dǝnyitthǝ i nung to a langǝ i. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Ɓa dǝ lona ɓǝ i ttha ɓǝ lobǝ than nung ba Fuh dang yayuu langkwoi bǝ gei ba Fuh i bǝ nanatthǝ, nǝ ǝn wuo ɗǝ. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Bǝɓa la nungdǝ gi ɓyang kwɔ tthǝɓǝ ɓǝthǝ, kwɔ i dǝɓǝ kwɔ ya gei ba tthasi gei ba yakku dǝnai loɓǝ ɓǝ. <verse eid="1TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Ɓato nungto i nungkwɔ langkwoi ɓa dǝ loɓǝtthǝ, yangbǝ yayuu ǝndǝi ɓyǝa nungto ɓǝ. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Ɓa kang lo ɓǝ i nungkwɔ i naɓǝ na tthǝɓǝ. Ɓa ǝǝnwa ɓǝ to i nungɓǝ kwɔ, bakwɔ nǝ dǝɓa to, ɓa to ǝn nungto lǝ loɓǝtthǝ i yakwɔ dǝna lǝɓǝ ɓǝ.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s">Nungto Kwɔ Ɓato Lǝ Tha Tthǝ Ɓǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />Bǝɓa gei ba i nyi lǝ yuu kwɔ ghaang ɓǝthǝ, kwoi a geiu ba mangǝttǝn u ǝn daa mǝ. Ɓato ya baittha mangǝttǝn i ǝn ya young ɓǝ kwɔ naa ɓǝ kun ɓǝ, <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />yasi kwɔ ghaang kwɔ mangǝn ya naa, langkwoi yathang asi mangǝn ya young ɓǝ i nung to a langǝ i. <verse eid="1TI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Ɓa dǝ angǝ a lǝ ya siɓui kwɔ la langǝ i kwɔ i inung tthǝi ɓǝ. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Kwoi nǝ ya siɓui tthǝ i yathang ko ya ka, i osi i nabǝ to nung to gi Fuh tthǝ ya dang woi gi langkwoi manungkwɔ ni yang i kwai than yayuu gi i ya baba gi, ǝn nungɓǝkwɔ Fuh dǝna lǝ tthǝla. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Siɓui kwɔ i nungtthǝu kwɔ, kwɔ yuu akun yangǝu dǝna nwongǝu kwɔ, u dǝnyitthǝ Fuh langkwoi u lilotthǝ bǝ pinwa i bǝ yam Fuh yangbǝ nwongǝu nungvii i dang fuh. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Kwoi siɓui akwɔ dǝna yidɗi tthǝla u owhsi u ɓuing, ko kwɔ u i nwongǝi ɓǝ. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Ɓa nainatthǝ nungkwɔ, yangbǝ bǝ yuu akun tǝi i nung a ɓko thǝ. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Kwoi nǝ yuu akun nhǝm ya byǝko lǝu, langkwoi ya dang woi gi, i labǝ dǝnyitthǝng langkwoi i pǝll yakwɔ dǝ ba a langǝ i tthǝlǝu ɓǝ. <verse eid="1TI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Bǝɓa lilo ya siɓui kwɔ ɓa vullǝ ɓǝthǝ nǝ tthai pǝll ttha thǝmtai ɗǝ. Langkwoi, u dǝbgwoi bo kun ɓuo <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />langkwoi yayuu ibǝing dǝu to nung a langǝ i: yisi kwɔ ttha yathang gu matthǝ ɓǝ, dǝu muo yayol gwoi gu, dǝu to nung to ibǝ ɓuob lo sua tthǝ ya Kristǝ, dǝu nwong yayuu dang zuii, dǝu dǝlo vii ǝndǝi bǝ tonung a langǝ i. <verse eid="1TI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Kwoi bǝɓa dǝ ɗuǝn yakwɔ kuu lǝu kwɔ dang ɗuǝn ya siɓui thǝ; bakwɔ nǝ ɗǝlak toi dǝnni yiɗi bǝ dǝbgwoi, i kwoi i yitthǝ bǝ muo sua Kristi, <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />langkwoi i wuolǝ kwan lǝ loi bakwɔ i dǝilo bǝ gwabnwa gi a nungsi lǝu. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Langkwoi langɓǝ dǝi ɓanglǝ lona dǝi thko gwoi yayuu; kwoi ɓkotthǝ, dǝi to dang nwa langkwoi dǝi thko nǝkwam, dǝi gei nungkwɔ kaso i gei thǝ ɓǝ. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Manungkwɔni yang dǝm yidɗi siɓui kwɔ ghaa lǝu kwɔ dǝb gwoi, i si yathang, i ttha yathang ɓǝ, i mab gwoi gi, yangbǝ bǝ i dǝlǝi lǝ ya ɓuiɓi geiba aɓau tthǝɓi thǝ. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Bakwɔ ya siɓui yakun mǝrǝm pa dǝna muo sua Shǝtan. <verse eid="1TI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Kwoi nǝ yisi ya dǝba a langǝ i akun tthǝ i siɓui ya dang woi gu, u nwongǝi bǝ u dǝ zuii lǝ ya kǝm pinwa thǝ, yangbǝ ya kǝm pinwa nwong ya siɓui kwɔ i nung tthǝi ɓǝ. <verse eid="1TI 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Yakku kǝm pinwa kwɔ dǝna to nungto matthǝ kwɔ i kwai nungkurɓǝ rabrab, manung yakwɔ dǝna tonungto niɓǝ bǝ gei ba ibǝ nanatthǝ nung. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Bakwɔ nungvullǝ ba Fuh gei angǝ, &lt;&lt;Bǝ a lam nwa nyak thǝ nǝ dǝmma to nung to i ulǝ zuk ɓǝ&gt;&gt; langkwoi &lt;&lt;I kwai ya nung to nungbusɔni gi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1TI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />Bǝ a lǝ bǝ ɓuobnwa lo yikku thǝ nǝ i wulǝ baɓǝ nwa ya shǝdǝ rab ko tai ɗǝ. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />A than nyi lo yakwɔ to nung a ɓko kwɔ dang nung yayuu, yangbǝ sua yayuu ǝndǝi survulli. <verse eid="1TI 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />Ɗǝgsi Fuh i a bǝ Kristi Yeso langkwoi a bǝ ya nwatummi Fuh a langǝ i dǝm lubǝimǝ a to nung to i bakwɔ bǝ a yiɗi yuu akun a yitthǝ yuu akun thǝ ko dǝtthǝ la lǝ yuu akun thǝ. <verse eid="1TI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Bǝ a thǝm tthǝmǝ bǝ dǝna lo yayuu babǝ to nung to Dangbang thǝ. Bǝ a to nung a ɓko i ya kunthǝ; a muo lomǝ matthǝ.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Bǝ a nwa mungki ɓuo thǝ, kwoi a nwa min tuab yangbǝ kai dang wa mǝ, ba tthǝ sɔnni mǝ kwɔ vii ǝndǝi ɓǝ.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Nung a ɓko yakun kai nǝkwam dǝi ɓyǝa, langkwoi nung a ɓko gi dǝna wuilǝ kwan tthǝ; kwoi nung a ɓko yakun natthǝ bǝ i ɓyǝa. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Manungɓǝni nung to a langǝ i kai nǝkwam yayuu ǝndǝi dǝna ɓyǝa, langkwoi i yakwɔ kai lǝu kwɔ i ɓuan i pyǝko.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Yakwɔ ǝn ya thǝb kwɔ i dǝ ghaali lǝ ya togwoi gi, yangbǝ bǝ yuu akun gei nung a ɓko tthǝ ɗuǝn Fuh thǝ langkwoi tthǝ bǝ nanatthǝ nungɓi thǝ. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Ya thǝb kwɔ ya togwoi gi ǝn ya Kristǝ kwɔ bǝ i tthǝmmǝi thǝ, bakwɔ i ǝn ya dǝ ba a langǝ i langɓǝ ɓǝ. Manungkwɔni yang, i toi nung to tthǝ matthǝ, bakwɔ yakwɔ dǝna lǝ tthǝla nung to gi kwɔ ǝn ya dǝ ba a langǝ i kwɔ dǝi yiɗi ɓǝ.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1TI 6:2">Bǝ Nanatthǝ Nung Pǝllǝ I Nungtǝi A Langǝ i</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">A nanatthǝ langkwoi a gei i nungkwɔ. <verse eid="1TI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Yuu akwɔ nanatthǝ nung akun i nungtthǝu langkwoi gwab ba a langǝ i gi Dangbang Yeso Kristi langkwoi ibǝ nanatthǝ nung gi Fuh ɓi lǝu <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />u fǝm mǝng i lo angǝ a langkwoi u ibǝ nunglǝu. Utthǝ i bǝ yidɗi nyimnwa i kwa nwa aɓau lǝba ba, langkwoi nungkwɔ dǝna wulǝ bǝ tthǝng tha, kwa nwa, ɗyǝam bǝ ɗu ba aɓau, <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />langkwoi bǝ nyimtha nwa vii ǝndǝi nwa yakwɔ lonyii to nung tou langkwoi i yangǝu i ba a langǝ iu. Dǝi ɓyǝa angǝ nunglǝi Fuh lǝ nunglǝi kwɔ i tǝi nungtǝi ɓǝ. <verse eid="1TI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Kwoi, nunglǝi Fuh dǝna dǝɓi nungtǝi, nǝ nungkwɔ naɓi kwɔ log ɓing ɓǝ. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Ən ɓǝttǝn ɓi wulǝ dang longwam kwa? Nung yangǝu! Ən ɓǝttǝn ɓi ɓuan ɓi lǝi ɓi ilǝ dang longwam kwa? Nung yangǝu! <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Nungkwɔ yang, nǝɓi tthǝ i nungtang i nunglitthǝ, naɓi tthǝng. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Kwoi yakwɔ dǝna yiɗi bǝ tǝi nungtǝi dǝna wɔ dang bǝ nabǝi langkwoi tarko sullǝ i nungkwɔ a thǝb bǝi kpaatthǝ, kwɔ dǝna gub bǝi dǝna wulǝ sua langkwoi dǝna thǝi. Bǝ Gub ɗuogsui A Tthasua <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Bakwɔ bǝ yiɗi nungkurɓǝ ǝn nungɓǝ lǝ pi nung to Mungkullum kwɔ ǝndǝi. Yakun dǝna yiɗi bǝ tǝiu ɗing kwɔ to i yitthǝ bǝ dǝnyitthǝ langkwoi i ɓanglǝ dang wai.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus Ghaiba Lǝ Timitawos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Kwoi mǝ, yuu gi Fuh, a la i nungkwɔ. A ɗuong nungmǝ bǝ to nung a langǝ i, nung to a langǝ i, bǝ dǝnyitthǝ, bǝ yiɗi bǝi, tthǝb nyitthǝ, ibǝ to nung tǝmtǝm. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />A surdum dǝnyitthǝ mǝ a langǝ i, yang a tǝi nwongǝi a ɗing; bakwɔ ǝn ba nwongǝi kwɔ nungkwɔ Fuh lubǝimǝ kwɔ a gei bǝ dǝnyitthǝ mǝ nyimtthǝ tthasi yayuu kpaatthǝ. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />Tthasi Fuh, kwɔ dǝ nwongǝi lǝ nung ǝndǝi ɓǝ, langkwoi tthasi Kristi Yeso, kwɔ gei bǝ dǝnyitthǝ gu nyimtthǝ tthasi Buntus Bilatus, dǝm gei ba <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />bǝ to nung to i bamǝ langkwoi ǝn tolǝ nung to tǝllǝ Vii kwɔ Dangbang ɓi Yeso Kristi a fugtthǝ ɓǝ. <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />Fuh a wulǝ bǝ fug gu lona a langǝ i, yuu akwɔ i khana lo langkwoi ulǝ ya lo yigwoi kun ɓuo, Yigwoi lo ya Yigwoi langkwoi Dangbang lo ya Dangbang. <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />U ɓuo u ɓuiu; u mangǝn lua kwɔ yuu akun gɓagǝu ɓǝ. Yuu akun yangǝu ɓyǝko bokun; yuu akun yangǝu a ɓuan a ɓyǝko. Ghaali i ttha a ɗing ǝn abo! Dǝitthǝ manungɓǝ. <verse eid="1TI 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />A gei yakwɔ tthǝ i nungtǝi a nung longwam kwɔ bǝ i lǝi loi thǝ, kwoi i dǝbǝ dǝnyitthǝ gi, lo i nungkwɔ bǝ dǝnyitthǝ yangǝu ɓǝ manung gi nungtǝi, kwoi i dǝ tthǝ Fuh, kwɔ dǝna ɓko nko dǝna dǝ ɓi nung lǝ babǝ lǝ tthǝla ɓiɓǝ. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />A gei i to nung to a langǝ i, i tǝi nung dang nung to a langǝ i, i ɓko nai langkwoi i gwab i gab nungnai i yakun. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />Nunglǝi kwɔ i gǝm nungtǝi lǝ loi tthǝ kwɔ lǝ pi kǝm a nyimmi tthasi ɓǝ. Langkwoi yang i ɓuan i tǝi nwongǝi kwɔ lǝ nwongǝi a langǝ i ɓǝ. <verse eid="1TI 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Timitawos, a dǝ nungkwɔ i da kwɔ matthǝ. A la bakwɔ ǝn a bǝ Fuh lǝuɓǝ i ba sullǝ kwɔ yakun dǝna lu angǝ&lt;&lt;Bǝ ibǝ nung ɓǝ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />Bakwɔ yakun dǝna lǝi angǝ i tthǝ ibǝ ibǝnung ɓǝ, langkwoi manungkwɔ niyang i yitthǝ nunglǝi bǝ dǝnyitthǝ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Nung a langǝ i gi Fuh ǝǝ i ɓǝlǝ ǝndǝi.<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>